flowchart TD
    A[Attacker compromises a DC or admin account] --> B[Dumps krbtgt account hash via DCSync - T1003.006]
    B --> C[Forges a TGT offline using krbtgt hash]
    C --> D[Ticket set to any account and any privilege level]
    D --> E[Ticket valid for years - T1558.001 Golden Ticket]
    E --> F{DC validates ticket signature}
    F -->|Signed with real krbtgt key| G[Ticket trusted by any DC in domain]
    G --> H[Attacker gains persistent access]
    H --> I[Normal user password reset occurs]
    I --> J[krbtgt hash unchanged - access still valid]
    J --> H
